!                                                                                                   
! Iodine atom, (5s)2 (5p1/2)2 (5p3/2)3 average of configuration,                                    
! ccECP with spin-orbit terms (issue #200).                                                         
!                                                                                                   
! I_gencontr.mol gives the s and p basis as general contraction blocks                              
! whose contracted functions share no primitive and whose exponents are                             
! not in descending order. Such a block is flagged as segmented, so the                             
! primitives must be reordered (PRIORD) also in ECP runs; before the fix                            
! the energy was -17.134 instead of -11.228 (the energy of the same                                 
! functions given as segmented blocks).                                                             
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
I atom, ccECP SOREP, general contraction blocks                                                     
.WAVE FUNCTION                                                                                      
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.ECP                                                                                                
**WAVE FUNCTION                                                                                     
.SCF                                                                                                
*SCF                                                                                                
.CLOSED SHELL                                                                                       
2 2                                                                                                 
.OPEN SHELL                                                                                         
1                                                                                                   
3/0,4                                                                                               
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0d-09                                                                                             
.MAXITR                                                                                             
150                                                                                                 
*END OF                                                                                             


